{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22157","headline":"兰若寓居 · 白居易","name":"兰若寓居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名宦老慵求，退身安草野。\n家园病嬾归，寄居在兰若。\n薜衣换簪组，藜杖代车马。\n行止辄自由，甚觉身潇洒。\n晨游南坞上，夜息东庵下。\n人间千万事，无有关心者。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}